-### Trajectory Logging
+Log every claim to trajectory in this shape:
 
 ```jsonl
 {"phase":"cite","claim":"JWT validates expiry","grounding":"citation","evidence":{"quote":"if (isExpired(token))","path":"${PROJECT_ROOT}/src/auth/jwt.ts","line":67}}
